function profileFields(){return [['gender','性别（男 / 女；按当前形态填写）'],['age','年龄'],['height','身高'],['identity','身份 / 岛上职责'],['type','形象类型'],['personality','性格特点'],['body','身材体态'],['face','面部识别'],['hair','发型方向'],['skin','肤色'],['wardrobe','穿搭方向'],['constraints','设计限制'],['notes','补充说明']]}
function profileCell(r,key,label){const value=r.profile?.[key],source=r.profileSources?.[key]||'来源未标注';return `<div class="profile-cell"><dt>${label}${value?`<span class="profile-origin" title="${esc(source)}">${source.includes('剧本')?'剧本':source.includes('用户')?'用户':source.includes('制作')?'设定':'待核'}</span>`:''}</dt><dd class="${value?'':'unfilled'}">${esc(value||'待补充')}</dd></div>`}
function renderRoleBrief(){const area=$('#roleBrief');if(!area)return;const wasOpen=area.querySelector('.role-context')?.open||false;const r=role();if(!r.id){area.innerHTML='<p class="brief-empty">先在项目中添加或选择角色，再展开填写人物资料。</p>';return}const details=`<div class="brief-heading"><div><span class="brief-label">人物资料</span><span class="brief-status">${esc(r.status||'设计中')}</span></div><button id="editBriefProfile">编辑角色资料 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div><dl class="brief-stats">${[['age','年龄'],['height','身高'],['identity','身份 / 岛上职责'],['type','形象类型']].map(([k,l])=>profileCell(r,k,l)).join('')}</dl><dl class="brief-character">${[['personality','性格特点'],['body','身材体态']].map(([k,l])=>profileCell(r,k,l)).join('')}</dl><details class="brief-more"><summary>更多设计依据 · 脸型、发型、穿搭与限制</summary><dl>${profileFields().filter(([k])=>!['age','height','identity','type','personality','body'].includes(k)).map(([k,l])=>profileCell(r,k,l)).join('')}</dl>${r.requirements?`<p class="brief-requirements"><strong>角色需求</strong>${esc(r.requirements)}</p>`:''}<p class="note">“设定”为制作建议，可调整；“剧本”为已整理的剧本依据。服装与脸部草案尚未确认时，不视为定稿。来源说明可悬停字段标签查看。</p></details>`;area.innerHTML=`<details class="role-context" ${wasOpen?'open':''}><summary><span class="brief-label">当前设计角色</span><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><span class="brief-status">${esc(r.status||'设计中')}</span><span class="role-context-action"><span>展开人物资料</span>${icon('down')}</span></summary><div class="role-context-body">${details}</div></details>`;$('#editBriefProfile').onclick=openRoleEditor}
function renderDetailRoleBrief(){const area=$('#detailRoleBrief');if(!area)return;const r=state.roles.find(r=>r.id===$('#targetRole')?.value)||role();area.innerHTML=`<div class="detail-role-title">设计对象 <strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong></div><p>${esc([r.profile?.age,r.profile?.height,r.profile?.type].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')||'尚未补充基础资料')}</p><p>${esc(r.profile?.personality||'性格特点待补充')}</p>`}
$('#profileFields').innerHTML=profileFields().map(([key,label])=>`<label>${label}<textarea id="profile-${key}" rows="${['age','height','skin'].includes(key)?1:2}" data-profile="${key}"></textarea><span id="origin-${key}" class="note"></span></label>`).join('');
const previousOpenRoleEditor=openRoleEditor;openRoleEditor=function(){previousOpenRoleEditor();const r=role();if(!r.id)return;for(const [key] of profileFields()){$('#profile-'+key).value=r.profile?.[key]||'';$('#origin-'+key).textContent=r.profileSources?.[key]||'未填写来源'}};
const previousRoleSubmit=$('#roleForm').onsubmit;$('#roleForm').onsubmit=e=>{const r=role();r.profile=r.profile||{};r.profileSources=r.profileSources||{};for(const [field,legacy] of [['gender','gender'],['age','age'],['type','description']]){const value=r.matchPreferences?.[legacy];if(value&&!String(r.profile[field]||'').trim()){r.profile[field]=value;r.profileSources[field]='历史匹配条件（用户填写）'}}for(const [key] of profileFields()){const value=$('#profile-'+key).value.trim();if(value!==(r.profile[key]||'')){r.profile[key]=value;r.profileSources[key]=value?'用户制作设定（可调整）':''}}previousRoleSubmit(e)};
$('#renameRole').onclick=openRoleEditor;renderRoleBrief();

function referenceParts(){return ['整体造型','服装与叠穿','脸型与五官','发型与头饰','鞋袜与配饰','配色与材质']}
function pickParts(p){return p?(Array.isArray(p.parts)&&p.parts.length?p.parts:[...(p.part||'整体造型').split('、')]):['整体造型']}
$('#partOptions').addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.name!=='referenceParts')return;const all=[...document.querySelectorAll('input[name="referenceParts"]')];if(e.target.checked&&e.target.value==='整体造型')all.filter(x=>x!==e.target).forEach(x=>x.checked=false);else if(e.target.checked)all.filter(x=>x.value==='整体造型').forEach(x=>x.checked=false)});
function showRoleBoard(){tab='board';filterState.assetType.clear();filterState.gender.clear();filterState.visual.clear();filterState.tags.clear();filterState.category='';filterState.primary='';filterState.secondary='';filterState.styleDirection='';filterState.styleDetail='';for(const key of attributeFilterKeys)filterState[key]='';$('#search').value='';$('#source').value='';if($('#roleEditor').open)$('#roleEditor').close();render();$('#results').scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'})}
const backToTop=$('#backToTop');let activeScrollTarget=window;const getScrollTop=target=>target===window?(window.scrollY||document.documentElement.scrollTop):target.scrollTop;const updateBackToTop=event=>{const target=event?.target;if(target instanceof Element&&target.scrollHeight>target.clientHeight&&target.scrollTop>0)activeScrollTarget=target;else if(target===document||target===window)activeScrollTarget=window;backToTop.classList.toggle('is-visible',getScrollTop(activeScrollTarget)>320)};document.addEventListener('scroll',updateBackToTop,{capture:true,passive:true});window.addEventListener('scroll',updateBackToTop,{passive:true});backToTop.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(activeScrollTarget!==window&&!activeScrollTarget.isConnected)activeScrollTarget=window;const options={top:0,behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'auto':'smooth'};activeScrollTarget===window?window.scrollTo(options):activeScrollTarget.scrollTo(options)});updateBackToTop();const baseRenderRoleBrief=renderRoleBrief;renderRoleBrief=function(){baseRenderRoleBrief();const r=role();if(!r.id)return;const node=document.createElement('div');node.className='role-workflow';node.innerHTML=`<p>角色资料是设计目标，<strong>${Object.keys(r.picks).length} 张预选</strong>是本角色的参考依据。</p><div><button id="viewRolePicks">查看本角色预选</button><button id="handoffRole" class="primary" ${r.status==='已选定'?'':'disabled'} title="${r.status==='已选定'?'保存方案并生成交接指令':'将方案状态设为已选定后可交接'}">交给 Codex</button></div>`;$('#roleBrief').append(node);$('#viewRolePicks').onclick=showRoleBoard;$('#handoffRole').onclick=()=>handoffRole(r.id)};
function renderRoleReferenceSummary(r){const picks=Object.entries(r.picks);$('#editorReferences').innerHTML=`<div class="reference-summary-heading"><h3>本角色的预选参考 <span>${picks.length} 张</span></h3><button type="button" id="editorViewPicks">查看全部预选</button></div><p class="note">资料描述“这个角色是谁”；下面的预选描述“具体参考哪些设计”。两者会一起交给 Codex。</p>${picks.length?`<div class="reference-summary-list">${picks.map(([id,p])=>{const x=items.find(x=>x.id===id);return x?`<div class="reference-summary-item"><img src="${x.thumb}" alt="预选参考 ${id}"><div><strong>${id}</strong><p>${esc(pickParts(p).join(' · '))}</p><small>${esc(p.note||'未填写备注')}</small></div></div>`:''}).join('')}</div>`:'<p class="note">尚未添加参考。可以为同一角色选多张图，每张图可选择多个参考部位。</p>'}`;$('#editorViewPicks').onclick=showRoleBoard}
const openRoleEditorWithProfile=openRoleEditor;openRoleEditor=function(){openRoleEditorWithProfile();if(role().id)renderRoleReferenceSummary(role())};$('#renameRole').onclick=openRoleEditor;renderRoleBrief();
let latestHandoff=null;
async function handoffRole(roleId){const target=state.roles.find(r=>r.id===roleId);if(target?.status!=='已选定'){toast('请先将方案状态设为已选定并保存');return}if(!connected||syncError){toast('请先连接本地服务并读取最新方案');return}queueSave();await pushChanges();if(syncError)return;try{const res=await fetch('/api/handoff',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({roleId,revision})});const data=await res.json();if(!res.ok)throw Error(data.error);latestHandoff=data;$('#handoffSummary').textContent=data.projectName+' / '+data.roleName+' · '+data.status+' · '+data.referenceCount+' 张预选';$('#handoffInstruction').value=data.instruction;$('#handoffPaths').textContent=data.jsonPath+'\n'+data.markdownPath;$('#handoffReferences').innerHTML=data.references.map(x=>`<p class="note"><strong>${esc(x.id)}</strong> · ${esc(x.parts.join(' / '))}${x.note?' · '+esc(x.note):''}</p>`).join('');$('#handoffDialog').showModal()}catch(e){toast('交接未完成：'+e.message)}}
$('#closeHandoff').onclick=()=>$('#handoffDialog').close();$('#copyHandoff').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText($('#handoffInstruction').value);toast('交接指令已复制，粘贴到 Codex 或 WorkBuddy 即可')}catch(e){$('#handoffInstruction').select();toast('已选中交接指令，请按 Ctrl+C 复制')}};
$('#saveAndHandoff').onclick=async()=>{if($('#editStatus').value!=='已选定'){toast('请先将方案状态设为已选定');return}if(!$('#roleForm').reportValidity())return;const id=role().id;$('#roleForm').requestSubmit();await handoffRole(id)};

function updateHandoffGate(){const enabled=$('#editStatus').value==='已选定';$('#saveAndHandoff').disabled=!enabled;$('#saveAndHandoff').title=enabled?'保存已选定方案并生成交接指令':'将方案状态设为已选定后可交接'}
const openRoleEditorBeforeGate=openRoleEditor;openRoleEditor=function(){openRoleEditorBeforeGate();updateHandoffGate()};$('#editStatus').addEventListener('change',updateHandoffGate);$('#renameRole').onclick=openRoleEditor;renderRoleBrief();



function updateMatchControls(){
 const loading=!!semanticTask,selected=roleMatchMode&&semanticResult?.signature===semanticSignature(),keyword=roleMatchMode&&!selected&&!loading;
 const semantic=$('#semanticMatch'),words=$('#roleMatch'),feedback=$('#matchFeedback'),status=$('#semanticStatus');
 semantic.disabled=false;semantic.classList.toggle('active',loading||selected);semantic.classList.toggle('is-loading',loading);semantic.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(selected));semantic.setAttribute('aria-busy',String(loading));
 semantic.textContent=loading?'匹配中… 点击取消':selected?'语义匹配 · 已选中':'语义匹配';semantic.title=loading?'点击取消本次匹配':selected?'再次点击退出语义匹配':'根据当前角色资料进行云端语义匹配';
 words.classList.toggle('active',keyword);words.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(keyword));words.textContent=keyword?'关键词匹配 · 已选中':'关键词匹配';words.title=keyword?'再次点击退出关键词匹配':'按当前角色资料中的关键词匹配';
 if(feedback){feedback.hidden=!loading&&!status.textContent.trim();feedback.classList.toggle('is-loading',loading);feedback.classList.toggle('is-selected',selected);$('#cancelSemantic').hidden=!loading&&!selected;$('#cancelSemantic').textContent=loading?'取消匹配':'退出语义匹配'}
}
function cancelSemanticMatch(message='已退出语义匹配，恢复素材浏览。',refresh=true){
 const task=semanticTask;semanticTask=null;semanticSequence++;task?.controller.abort();semanticResult=null;roleMatchMode=false;lastResultKey='';
 if(message)$('#semanticStatus').textContent=message;
 if(refresh)render();else updateMatchControls();
}
$('#semanticMatch').onclick=async()=>{
 if(semanticTask||(roleMatchMode&&semanticResult?.signature===semanticSignature())){cancelSemanticMatch(semanticTask?'已取消本次匹配，恢复素材浏览。':'已退出语义匹配，恢复素材浏览。');return}
 if(!role().id){toast('先选择角色');return}
 if(!ensureRoleMatchReady())return;
 const r=matchingRole(),signature=semanticSignature(),status=$('#semanticStatus');
 const task={id:++semanticSequence,controller:new AbortController(),signature};semanticTask=task;semanticResult=null;roleMatchMode=false;tab='all';
 const current=()=>semanticTask===task&&!task.controller.signal.aborted;
 status.textContent=`正在为“${r.name}”匹配参考，请稍候…`;render();
 try{
  const query=Retrieval.positive([r.profile?.gender,r.profile?.age,r.profile?.type,r.profile?.personality,r.profile?.body,r.profile?.face,r.profile?.hair,r.profile?.wardrobe,r.requirements].filter(Boolean).join('；'));
  if(!window.SemanticSearch)await import(new URL('js/semantic.js?v=20261113-match-state-1',document.baseURI).href);
  if(!current())return;
  const scores=await window.SemanticSearch.search(query,message=>{if(current()){status.textContent=`正在为“${r.name}”匹配参考 · ${message}`;updateMatchControls()}},{signal:task.controller.signal});
  if(!current())return;
  if(signature!==semanticSignature()){cancelSemanticMatch('角色资料已变化，请重新匹配。');return}
  const expected=new Map(scores.map(x=>[x.id,x])),valid=new Map();
  await Promise.all(items.filter(x=>expected.has(x.id)).map(async x=>{const bytes=await crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256',new TextEncoder().encode(Retrieval.document(x)));const hash=Array.from(new Uint8Array(bytes),b=>b.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');const entry=expected.get(x.id);if(hash===entry.hash&&Number.isFinite(entry.score))valid.set(x.id,entry.score)}));
  if(!current())return;
  if(signature!==semanticSignature()){cancelSemanticMatch('角色资料已变化，请重新匹配。');return}
  if(!valid.size)throw Error('语义索引与当前素材不一致，请重新生成索引');
  semanticTask=null;semanticResult={signature,scores:valid};roleMatchMode=true;lastResultKey='';status.textContent=`语义匹配已完成 · “${r.name}” · 点击已选中按钮或右侧“退出语义匹配”可恢复浏览。`;render();
 }catch(error){if(!current())return;semanticTask=null;semanticResult=null;roleMatchMode=false;status.textContent='语义匹配未完成：'+error.message+'。可重试或使用关键词匹配。';render()}
 finally{if(semanticTask===task)semanticTask=null;updateMatchControls()}
};
$('#cancelSemantic').onclick=()=>cancelSemanticMatch(semanticTask?'已取消本次匹配，恢复素材浏览。':'已退出语义匹配，恢复素材浏览。');

function clearOtherMatchFilters(){
 $('#search').value='';$('#source').value='';for(const value of Object.values(filterState))if(value instanceof Set)value.clear();for(const key of ['category','primary','secondary','styleDirection','styleDetail',...attributeFilterKeys])filterState[key]='';tab='all';render();
}
function ensureRoleMatchReady(){
 const check=Retrieval.readiness(role());if(check.ready)return true;
 const message=`${role().name}的角色方案缺少${check.missing.join('、')}。请点击“编辑角色方案”补充后匹配。`;
 $('#semanticStatus').textContent=message;updateMatchControls();toast(message);return false;
}
function startKeywordMatch(){
 if(!role().id){toast('先在项目中添加或选择角色');return}
 const wasKeyword=roleMatchMode&&!semanticTask&&semanticResult?.signature!==semanticSignature();
 if(!wasKeyword&&!ensureRoleMatchReady())return;
 cancelSemanticMatch('',false);roleMatchMode=!wasKeyword;if(roleMatchMode)tab='all';
 $('#semanticStatus').textContent=roleMatchMode?'关键词匹配已选中 · 再次点击关键词按钮可恢复素材浏览。':'已退出关键词匹配，恢复素材浏览。';render();
}
